  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更好的樹葉（Better Leaves）為樹葉方塊添加了額外層次，使其看起來更加茂密、濃密且自然。</span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/296616/description_9d06bbdd-8ddf-4736-9d77-6167f48dac56.webp\" alt=\"一張展示樹葉方塊與文字「Better Leaves」的橫幅\" width=\"739\" height=\"118\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">9.0 版本專注於效能提升，每種樹葉都會自動生成紋理。與 8.1 版本不同，這並非動態生成，因此您需要遵循幾個簡單步驟來為材質包編譯自訂版本。</span></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RL_--nShJ9w\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 8.1 版本及更低版本中，此資源包不添加任何紋理，因此能與幾乎所有資源包和模組直接相容（紋理會動態調整）。但這是以犧牲效能為代價的。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>我強烈建議在安裝 Sodium/Embeddium 的同時，也安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fcull-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Leaves</a> 模組，以獲得更高的 FPS。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>喜歡這個包嗎？來看看我的另一個包：</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/round-trees-mc-vanilla-1-8-1-13\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Round Trees</strong></a><strong>。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/round-trees-mc-vanilla-1-8-1-13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/296616/description_dd79c2f8-007f-491a-98b2-ced3f8c5b4bf.webp\" alt=\"一個圓形樹幹，上方有標題「Round Trees」\" width=\"496\" height=\"91\"></span></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/893/699/betterleavesbop.jpg\" width=\"842\" height=\"219\"></p><p>明確支援的模組（v9.5）：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitects-palette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architect's Palette</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Elemental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faurorasdecorations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aurora's Decorations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbewitchment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bewitchment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiome-makeover\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Makeover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblockus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblossom\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blossom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbountiful-fares\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful Fares</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/mod/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Croptopia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeep-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Aether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dreamwoods\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dreamwoods</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees (+ 附加組件)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fecologics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenderscape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderscape</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fends-phantasm\" rel=\"nofollow\">End's Phantasm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenvironmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feternal-starlight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eternal Starlight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fforbidden-arcanus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden and Arcanus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffruits-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fruits Delight</a></li>\n<l